#. Description of the 'Background Opacity' (Percent) field in DocType
#. 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
#, python-format
msgid ""
"100% shows the image or the drawn signature with full color. A lower value "
"makes it lighter, so that the text is easier to read. Without text, use "
"100%."
msgstr ""
"Con 100 % la imagen o la firma dibujada se muestran con todo su color. Un "
"valor menor las aclara para que el texto se lea mejor. Sin texto, use 100 %."

#. Header text in the PDF Signer Workspace
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/workspace/pdf_signer/pdf_signer.json
msgid "<span class=\"h4\">PDF Signer</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"h4\">PDF Signer</span>"

#. Description of the 'Background Image' (Attach Image) field in DocType
#. 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "A PNG or JPG image behind the text, for example a stamp of the company."
msgstr "Imagen PNG o JPG detrás del texto, por ejemplo el sello de la empresa."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.js:70
msgid ""
"A blank A4 page with the signature box. The preview shows your user name in "
"place of the name of the certificate holder."
msgstr ""
"Una página A4 en blanco con el recuadro de firma. La vista previa muestra su"
" nombre de usuario en lugar del nombre del titular del certificado."

#. Description of the 'Additional Text' (Data) field in DocType 'Electronic
#. Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
#, python-format
msgid "A text for the variable %(additional)s, for example the name of the company."
msgstr "Texto para la variable %(additional)s, por ejemplo el nombre de la empresa."

#. Option for the 'QR Code Position' (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Above Text"
msgstr "Encima del texto"

#. Label of the access_tab (Tab Break) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Access"
msgstr "Acceso"

#. Description of the 'Long-Term Validation' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"Add to the PDF the revocation data (OCSP or CRL) of the certificates and a "
"document time stamp (PAdES B-LTA). Then the signature can be validated after"
" the certificate expires. The certificate must give OCSP or CRL addresses, "
"and the server must reach them and the TSA."
msgstr ""
"Añade al PDF los datos de revocación (OCSP o CRL) de los certificados y un "
"sello de tiempo del documento (PAdES B-LTA). Así la firma se puede validar "
"después de que caduque el certificado. El certificado debe indicar "
"direcciones OCSP o CRL, y el servidor debe poder acceder a ellas y a la TSA."

#. Label of the additional (Data) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Additional Text"
msgstr "Texto adicional"

#. Label of the algorithm (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo"

#. Label of the always_ask (Check) field in DocType 'Global Settings PDF
#. Signer'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/global_settings_pdf_signer/global_settings_pdf_signer.json
msgid "Always Ask to Sign when PDF is Uploaded in any Doctype"
msgstr ""
"Preguntar siempre si se desea firmar al adjuntar un PDF en cualquier "
"documento"

#. Description of the 'Contact Information' (Data) field in DocType 'Electronic
#. Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"An email or a phone to contact the signer. PDF readers show it in the "
"signature panel."
msgstr ""
"Correo electrónico o teléfono de contacto del firmante. Los lectores de PDF "
"lo muestran en el panel de firmas."

#. Label of the appearance_tab (Tab Break) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Apariencia"

#. Option for the 'Signature Type' (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
#: pdf_signer/public/js/file.js:147
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Aprobación"

#. Description of the 'Signature Type' (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic
#. Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"Approval: other people can sign the PDF after you. Certification: the first "
"signature of the PDF. It sets which changes are allowed after it. With No "
"Changes, any later change makes the signature not valid. With Form Filling "
"and Signing, other people can fill the form fields and sign. A PDF can have "
"only one certification signature, and it must be the first."
msgstr ""
"Aprobación: otras personas pueden firmar el PDF después de usted. "
"Certificación: es la primera firma del PDF y fija qué cambios se permiten "
"después. Con «Sin cambios», cualquier cambio posterior invalida la firma. "
"Con «Rellenar formularios y firmar», otras personas pueden rellenar los "
"campos del formulario y firmar. Un PDF solo puede tener una firma de "
"certificación, y debe ser la primera."

