#. Description of the 'QR Code Position' (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic
#. Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "The place of the QR code in the signature box."
msgstr "Posición del código QR dentro del recuadro de firma."

#. Description of the 'Position' (Select) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"The place of the signature box on the page. With Custom, you give the "
"distance from the bottom-left corner of the page."
msgstr ""
"Posición del recuadro de firma en la página. Con «Personalizada», usted "
"indica la distancia desde la esquina inferior izquierda de la página."

#. Description of the 'TSA Root Certificate' (Attach) field in DocType
#. 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"The root certificate of the TSA (.cer, .crt or .pem). The verification uses "
"it to trust the time stamps. Get it from the website of the TSA."
msgstr ""
"Certificado raíz de la TSA (.cer, .crt o .pem). La verificación lo usa para "
"confiar en los sellos de tiempo. Descárguelo de la web de la TSA."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.js:39
msgid "The sign setting is disabled."
msgstr "Se ha desactivado el perfil de firma."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.js:38
msgid "The sign setting is enabled."
msgstr "Se ha activado el perfil de firma."

#: pdf_signer/utils/appearance.py:68
msgid "The sign setting puts the signature on page {0}, but the PDF has {1} pages."
msgstr ""
"El perfil de firma coloca la firma en la página {0}, pero el PDF tiene {1} "
"páginas."

#: pdf_signer/utils/permission.py:61
msgid "The sign setting {0} is disabled."
msgstr "El perfil de firma {0} está desactivado."

#: pdf_signer/utils/appearance.py:108
msgid ""
"The signature box does not fit on the page. Make it smaller, or change its "
