msgstr "La firma usa el campo de firma vacío {0} del PDF."

#. Description of the 'Text Size' (Int) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "The size of the text in points."
msgstr "Tamaño del texto en puntos."

#: pdf_signer/utils/appearance.py:189
msgid "The style Text needs a text."
msgstr "El estilo Texto necesita un texto."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.py:49
msgid "The style Text needs a text. Write the Text, or select another style."
msgstr "El estilo Texto necesita un texto. Escriba el texto o elija otro estilo."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.py:60
#, python-format
msgid "The text has a % sign that is not a variable. Write %% to show a % sign."
msgstr ""
"El texto tiene un signo % que no es una variable. Escriba %% para mostrar un"
" signo %."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.py:55
msgid "The text has an unknown variable: {0}. Use only {1}."
msgstr "El texto tiene una variable desconocida: {0}. Use solo {1}."

#. Description of the 'Text' (Small Text) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The text of the signature box. You can use these variables: %(signer)s the "
"name of the certificate holder, %(ts)s the date and time of the signature, "
"%(reason)s, %(location)s and %(additional)s. Leave it empty to show only the"
" QR code, the image or the drawn signature."
msgstr ""
"Texto del recuadro de firma. Puede usar estas variables: %(signer)s el "
"nombre del titular del certificado, %(ts)s la fecha y hora de la firma, "
"%(reason)s, %(location)s y %(additional)s. Déjelo vacío para mostrar solo el"
" código QR, la imagen o la firma dibujada."

#. Description of the 'QR Code Content' (Small Text) field in DocType
#. 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"The text or the web address in the QR code. If it is empty, the QR code "
"contains the Additional Text, or the address of this site."
msgstr ""
"Texto o dirección web del código QR. Si se deja vacío, el código QR contiene"
" el texto adicional o, si tampoco hay, la dirección de este sitio."

#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.py:42
msgid "The width and the height of the signature box must be more than 0."
msgstr "El ancho y el alto del recuadro de firma deben ser mayores que 0."

#. Description of the 'Border Width' (Int) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "The width of the line around the box, in points. 0 means no border."
msgstr "Grosor de la línea que rodea el recuadro, en puntos. 0 significa sin borde."

#. Description of the 'Width (mm)' (Float) field in DocType 'Electronic Sign
#. Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "The width of the signature box in millimeters."
msgstr "Ancho del recuadro de firma en milímetros."

