#. Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid "Users That Can Sign"
msgstr "Usuarios que pueden firmar"

#. Description of the 'Roles That Can Sign' (Table MultiSelect) field in
#. DocType 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"Users with one of these roles can sign with this setting. If it is empty and"
" there are no users, only the PDF Signer Manager and the System Manager can "
"sign."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios con alguno de estos roles pueden firmar con este perfil. Si se "
"deja vacío y no hay usuarios, solo pueden firmar el Gestor de PDF Signer y "
"el Administrador del sistema."

#. Description of the 'Roles That Can Verify' (Table MultiSelect) field in
#. DocType 'Electronic Sign Setting'
#: pdf_signer/pdf_signer/doctype/electronic_sign_setting/electronic_sign_setting.json
msgid ""
"Users with one of these roles can verify signatures with this setting. If it"
" is empty, all the users that can read the PDF can verify."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios con alguno de estos roles pueden verificar firmas con este "
"perfil. Si se deja vacío, puede verificar cualquier usuario que pueda leer "
"el PDF."

